          caption: "Before every penicillin, the question; after every new drug, the daily look at the skin, the mouth and the eyes. The sulphonamide in cotrimoxazole and the nevirapine in first-line ART are the two drugs most likely to put a Ghanaian patient in a burns bed with Stevens-Johnson syndrome.",
